    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93635" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελην-ιάζομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be
			moonstruck</i>, i.e. <i>epileptic,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Matt.
				4.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				113.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be sublunar</i>, i.e. subject to change and decay, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ομένης τῆς φύσεως</span> Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.107
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(3).146
			</span></i>.</div>
